  "tarball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/bitwarden/android/tarball/v2026.9.0-bwpm",
  "zipball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/bitwarden/android/zipball/v2026.9.0-bwpm",
  "body": "# Overview\r\n* Improved account security\r\n* Smoother folder menus and clearer confirmations when saving\r\n* Fixed plan details not updating after upgrading to Premium\r\n* Fixed Manage devices screen not showing new login requests\r\n\r\n<!-- Release notes generated using configuration in .github/release.yml at release/2026.9-rc62 -->\r\n\r\n## What's Changed\r\n### :shipit: Feature Development\r\n* PM-31118: feat: Add support for SDK pin unlock by @david-livefront in https://github.com/bitwarden/android/pull/7289\r\n* [PM-41291] feat: Add model and data layer for Identity Autofill by @aj-rosado in https://github.com/bitwarden/android/pull/7232\r\n* PM-33857: feat: Add User Notification Policy banner by @david-livefront in https://github.com/bitwarden/android/pull/7303\r\n* PM-32858: feat: Update password salt creation by @david-livefront in https://github.com/bitwarden/android/pull/7312\r\n* [PM-41292] feat: Add heuristic detection for identity autofill fields by @aj-rosado in https://github.com/bitwarden/android/pull/7233\r\n* PM-32154: Feat: Update salt for new registration model by @david-livefront in https://github.com/bitwarden/android/pull/7324\r\n* PM-42849: Feat: Update Debug menu UI by @david-livefront in https://github.com/bitwarden/android/pull/7338\r\n* PM-42467: feat: Add debug menu option to share settings by @david-livefront in https://github.com/bitwarden/android/pull/7350\r\n### 🐛 Bug fixes\r\n* [PM-36378] fix: Show the new folder created snackbar by @andrebispo5 in https://github.com/bitwarden/android/pull/7299\r\n* [PM-36231] fix: Show Select without dashes on vault add edit menus by @andrebispo5 in https://github.com/bitwarden/android/pull/7301\r\n* [PM-36379] fix: Show the item type in the save snackbar by @andrebispo5 in https://github.com/bitwarden/android/pull/7308\r\n* [PM-36378] fix: Remove the period from the new folder created snackbar by @andrebispo5 in https://github.com/bitwarden/android/pull/7336\r\n* [PM-41929] fix: Update the manage devices screen when a passwordless request push is received by @aj-rosado in https://github.com/bitwarden/android/pull/7280\r\n* [PM-40535] fix: Organization policy restriction notice padding and icon by @andrebispo5 in https://github.com/bitwarden/android/pull/7341\r\n* [PM-36378] fix: Remove \"New folder created\" snackbar from add/edit cipher flow by @andrebispo5 in https://github.com/bitwarden/android/pull/7345\r\n* PM-42839, PM-42840, PM-42841, PM-42842: bug: Minor DatePicker bug fixes by @david-livefront in https://github.com/bitwarden/android/pull/7343\r\n* [PM-41836] fix: Promote Plan screen off Free view without requiring an in-flight checkout by @aj-rosado in https://github.com/bitwarden/android/pull/7337\r\n* [PM-36376] fix: Clear folder and owner dropdown lag after a card scan by @andrebispo5 in https://github.com/bitwarden/android/pull/7353\r\n* 🍒 PM-43235: bug: Remove edit button for disabled Send types by @david-livefront in https://github.com/bitwarden/android/pull/7375\r\n### ⚙️ Maintenance\r\n* Crowdin Pull by @bw-ghapp[bot] in https://github.com/bitwarden/android/pull/7291\r\n* PM-42381: chore: Separate AuthState and organizations from AuthRepository by @david-livefront in https://github.com/bitwarden/android/pull/7296\r\n* Chore: Update app version name to 2026.9.0 by @david-livefront in https://github.com/bitwarden/android/pull/7317\r\n* PM-42616: Chore: Consolidate keys model by @david-livefront in https://github.com/bitwarden/android/pull/7322\r\n* Crowdin Pull by @bw-ghapp[bot] in https://github.com/bitwarden/android/pull/7327\r\n* chore: Rollback setpassword API changes by @david-livefront in https://github.com/bitwarden/android/pull/7349\r\n* Added workflow placeholder by @mpbw2 in https://github.com/bitwarden/android/pull/7351\r\n### 📦 Dependency Updates\r\n* Deps: Update OkHttp to v5.5.0 by @david-livefront in https://github.com/bitwarden/android/pull/7307\r\n* Deps: Update Androidx dependencies by @david-livefront in https://github.com/bitwarden/android/pull/7306\r\n* Deps: Update AGP to v9.3.2 by @david-livefront in https://github.com/bitwarden/android/pull/7305\r\n* Update SDK to 3.0.0-8495-c1b859a9 by @bw-ghapp[bot] in https://github.com/bitwarden/android/pull/7295\r\n* Deps: Update Firebase by @david-livefront in https://github.com/bitwarden/android/pull/7310\r\n* Deps: Update Junit to v6.1.3 by @david-livefront in https://github.com/bitwarden/android/pull/7314\r\n* Deps: Update to Kotlin v2.4.10 by @david-livefront in https://github.com/bitwarden/android/pull/7315\r\n* Deps: Update Google dependencies by @david-livefront in https://github.com/bitwarden/android/pull/7316\r\n* Deps: Update to Glide v5.0.9 by @david-livefront in https://github.com/bitwarden/android/pull/7318\r\n* Deps: Update Androidx Camera dependencies by @david-livefront in https://github.com/bitwarden/android/pull/7323\r\n* [deps]: Update csv to v3.3.6 by @renovate[bot] in https://github.com/bitwarden/android/pull/7330\r\n* [deps]: Update com.google.devtools.ksp to v2.3.11 by @renovate[bot] in https://github.com/bitwarden/android/pull/7329\r\n* [deps]: Update slackapi/slack-github-action action to v4 by @renovate[bot] in https://github.com/bitwarden/android/pull/7334\r\n* [deps]: Update codecov/codecov-action action to v7 by @renovate[bot] in https://github.com/bitwarden/android/pull/7333\r\n* [deps]: Update actions/checkout action to v7 by @renovate[bot] in https://github.com/bitwarden/android/pull/7332\r\n* [deps]: Lock file maintenance by @renovate[bot] in https://github.com/bitwarden/android/pull/7335\r\n* Update SDK to 3.0.0-8671-5d8ae614 by @bw-ghapp[bot] in https://github.com/bitwarden/android/pull/7320\r\n### 🎨 Other\r\n* llm: Dispatch bitwarden-software-engineer as a subagent for SDK-update evaluation by @SaintPatrck in https://github.com/bitwarden/android/pull/7313\r\n* llm: Exclude claude-code-action's restored config paths from the SDK-update push guard by @SaintPatrck in https://github.com/bitwarden/android/pull/7321\r\n\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/bitwarden/android/compare/v2026.8.1-bwpm...v2026.9.0-bwpm\r\n**Builds Source:** https://github.com/bitwarden/android/actions/runs/34485247881",
